          <metadata>
            <title>WN11-00-000100 - Internet Information System (IIS) or its subcomponents must not be installed on a workstation.</title>
            <affected family="windows">
              <platform>Microsoft Windows 11</platform>
            </affected>
            <description>IIS is not installed by default. Installation of Internet Information System (IIS) may allow unauthorized internet services to be hosted. Websites must only be hosted on servers that have been designed for that purpose and can be adequately secured.</description>
